<div class="kg-prose"><div class="lead">Every figure, callout and accent in this notebook is sampled from seaborn's <b>icefire</b> diverging map. The convention is consistent throughout: <b>ice reads as supply, capacity and plan</b>; <b>ember reads as price, pressure and realised cash</b>; the deep indigo centre carries structure and neutral series.</div></div>

<div class="kg-ramp">
  <span style="background:#bde7db"></span><span style="background:#84c1cf"></span><span style="background:#4c9ccd"></span>
